{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/perf3j","slide":5,"text":"This is the core idea: a useful test fails on the old code and passes on the proposed fix. Popper measures change, not confidence.\n\n[Sources]\n- /Users/NithinAwasome/Downloads/Daytona-Hacksprint/lib/pipeline.ts — conclusive evidence logic\n- /Users/NithinAwasome/Downloads/Daytona-Hacksprint/lib/pipeline.test.ts — verdict behavior tests"}
